{"subtitle":"","author":"子戈","category":"专栏 · 看片指南","collection":"","publishedAt":"2023-03-30T18:30","status":"published","cover":"/uploads/archive/img-8979/fig-001.jpg","festival":"","partnership":false,"id":"img-8979","title":"4月院线：小片扎堆，谁能突围？","archiveCategory":"guide","blocks":[{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"4月院线：小片扎堆，谁能突围？ · 配图 1","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-8979/fig-001.jpg","imageText":""},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"4月院线：小片扎堆，谁能突围？ · 配图 2","caption":"","width":70,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-8979/fig-002.jpg","imageText":"4月院线看片指南√口√口"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"4月院线：小片扎堆，谁能突围？ · 配图 3","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-8979/fig-003.jpg","imageText":"最为期待 —2部\nOur Aspiration!"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"4月院线：小片扎堆，谁能突围？ · 配图 4","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-8979/fig-004.jpg","imageText":"《宇宙探索编辑部》\n月\n9.0\n期待值 JOURWESY"},{"text":"上映日期：4月1日1第1个周六出品方：中影/导演：孔天山","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"豆瓣分：8.7（截至发稿）/预计票房：1-3亿","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"看点国产伪纪录片终于要有代表作了？","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"作为2021年的平遥爆款，我已经被看过的朋友吊足了胃口。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"从孔天山前作短片《法制未来时》可知，他非常善于一本止经地胡说八道。某种程度上，这也止应了伪纪录片的本质：用最逼具的形式，拍一件假事儿。其趣味就在于假与真之间的张力，而且形式越真，事儿越假，就越有看头儿。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"《宇由探索编辑部》也是伪纪录片，讲的是民科找UFO的故事。从前期高到离谱的口碑可以预见，国产伪纪录终于要有代表作了。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"4月院线：小片扎堆，谁能突围？ · 配图 5","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-8979/fig-005.jpg","imageText":"《灌篮高手》\n8.0\n期待值"},{"text":"上映日期：4月20日1第4个周四出品方：东映/导演：井上雄彦","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"豆瓣分：9.2（截至发稿）/预计票房：3-6亿","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"看点√和《铃芽之旅》谁更能打？特别提示本片无删减","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"就日本本土表现，《铃芽之旅》更胜一筹，卖到142.2亿（日元），而《灌篮高手》作为东映第二部破百亿的动画，也卖了约112亿（日元）。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"到了此地，结果还很难说。与其说是票房之争，不如说是两届观众的较量。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"《铃芽之旅》顶看新海诚的纯爱招牌，核心受众是25岁以下的青少年；而《灌蓝高手》主打怀旧牌，主力受众是25一40岁的80、90后们。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"那么我们可以拭目以待，看是纯爱力量大，还是怀旧力量大？","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"值得关注 10部It'sNoteworthy","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"4月院线：小片扎堆，谁能突围？ · 配图 6","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-8979/fig-006.jpg","imageText":"《超级马力欧兄弟大电影》\n6.5\n期待值"},{"text":"上映日期：4月5日1第2个周三","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"出品方：环球/导演：亚伦·霍瓦斯&迈克尔·杰勒尼克","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"预计：豆瓣分5.5-7.0票房1-3亿","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"看点口老IP能焕发新生吗？持别提示口本片无册删减","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"据说前前后后制作了6年。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"士天堂灵魂人物、马里奥兄之父宫本茂，在接受采访时说，最难处理的就是游戏与电影的平衡一一到底该忠于游戏受众，还是打造独立电影。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"在我看来，显然后者才是出路。毕竟是老IP了，兄弟情和英雄救美也都太过陈旧，理想做法就是保留人设和经典元素，创造全新的故事。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"当然，这都是猜想，从预告片看，重走老路的可能性更大。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"4月院线：小片扎堆，谁能突围？ · 配图 7","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-8979/fig-007.jpg","imageText":"《爱很美味》\n6.5\n爱很美味\n期待值 4月15白/原班人马电影院览"},{"text":"上唤日期：4月15日1第3个周六出品方：华谊兄第/导演：陈正道&许肇任预计：豆瓣分6.0-7.0/票房5000万-1.5亿","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"看点√剧而优则影，可行吗？","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"原班人马制作的后传电影。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"当初剧小爆了一下，原因在于拿捏准了火候。它由现实切口进入，展现当代女性的种种遭遇，最后又暗渡陈仓，回归到甜宠剧的套路中，让观众先苦后甜，于是甜上加甜。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"这次跨了媒介，进入大银幕，对单片质量期侍不高，只是好奇会有多少观众因为认可剧而走进影院，以及，这能否成为一种新的创作思路？","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"当然，更可能的结果是，和此地电影业的种种灵光乍现一样，最后都成了孤本。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"4月院线：小片扎堆，谁能突围？ · 配图 8","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-8979/fig-008.jpg","imageText":"《龙马精神》\n6.0\n期待值"},{"text":"上映日期：4月7日1第2个周五出品方：阿里巴巴影业/导演：杨子预计：豆瓣分5.5-6.5/票房2-5亿","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"影片贺岁气质很强，但由于疫情撤档，一拖就到了清明档。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"成龙的票房号召力不复当年，这次扮演一个落魄的龙虎武师，倒是有几分应景。与他配戏的是刘浩存和郭麒麟，但从预告片看，对手戏最多的很可能是一匹赤兔马。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"龙、马、兔、虎，十二生肖续集？","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"4月院线：小片扎堆，谁能突围？ · 配图 9","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-8979/fig-009.jpg","imageText":"《绝地追击》\n6.0\n期待值"},{"text":"上映日期：4月7日1第2个周五出品方：爱奇艺/导演：邱礼涛","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"预计：豆瓣分5.0-6.0／票房2000万-1亿","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"看点一年（至少)一部的邱礼涛，还能稳定发挥？","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"邱礼涛又有新片了，这次是边境缉毒题材。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"说他多产，倒不如说他职业。一个成熟的电影产业，往往要靠一群这样的职业导演才能支撑起来。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"无他，唯手熟尔。更何况完成度都不低，隔三差五还能出个把爆款。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"公众号的写手们，都该视邱礼涛为榜样。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"4月院线：小片扎堆，谁能突围？ · 配图 10","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-8979/fig-010.jpg","imageText":"《暴风》\n6.0\n期待值"},{"text":"上映日期：4月14日1第3个周五出品方：广东珠影/导演：陈嘉上","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"预计：豆瓣分5.0-6.5/票房2000万-6000万","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"每年都少不了几部港导拍的双雄戏，刚刚送别《风再起时》和《断网》，又迎来了陈嘉上的《暴风》。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"万变不离其宗，都是相似的味道。比起前二者来，《暴风》在阵容上还有缩水，又是年代片，趣味更偏小众。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"更何况，看看近些年的成绩单，我们也很难对陈嘉上有过高的期待。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"4月院线：小片扎堆，谁能突围？ · 配图 11","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-8979/fig-011.jpg","imageText":"《长沙夜生活》\n5.5\n期待值"},{"text":"上映日期：4月28日1第5个周五出品方：我们制作/导演：张翼","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"预计：豆瓣分5.5-6.5/票房1000万-5000万","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"看点口陈可羊御用编剧的导演处女作。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"本片导演张翼是陈可辛的御用编剧，曾参与《中国合伙人》《亲爱的》《夺冠》等多部作品。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"这一次他直执导筒，也请来了陈可羊担当监制。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"这部电影以长沙这座城市为焦点，展现一组小人物的悲欢离合。能否拍出烟火气和城市性格，将决定作品的成色。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"4月院线：小片扎堆，谁能突围？ · 配图 12","caption":"","width":90,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-8979/fig-012.jpg","imageText":"《长空之王》"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"4月院线：小片扎堆，谁能突围？ · 配图 13","caption":"","width":85,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-8979/fig-013.jpg","imageText":"5.5\n期待值"},{"text":"上映日期：4月28日1第5个周五出品方：上海亭东影业/导演：刘晓世预计：豆瓣分5.5-6.5/票房3-8亿","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"看点口戏里戏外，军备竞赛。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"司样是拍战机，拍飞行员，让人很难不对标《壮志凌云2：独行侠》。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"后者因在疫情期间票房大卖，被奉为救市之作；而《长空之王》显然是另一番命运一一先是高调定档，后又突然撤档。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"可以想见，《长空之主》上映后，又会掀起新一波口水战。毕竟，这是一个全面右倾、言必称意识形态的时代。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"4月院线：小片扎堆，谁能突围？ · 配图 14","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-8979/fig-014.jpg","imageText":"《人生路不熟》\n5.5\n易小星\n期待值 导演作品"},{"text":"上映日期：4月28日1第5个周五出品方：上海亭东影业/导演：易小星预计：豆瓣分5.0-6.0/票房2-5亿","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"易小星的电影，从来都把低俗当通俗。而且他颇有自信，觉得自己长在了大众的笑点上。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"这种自信本来挺荒谬的，但票房却每每证明，他的自信并不是空穴来风。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"看这次的预告片，依旧是老样子。但也没办法，都是市场惯出来的。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"4月院线：小片扎堆，谁能突围？ · 配图 15","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-8979/fig-015.jpg","imageText":"《惊天救援》\n5.0\n期待值"},{"text":"上映日期：4月28日1第5个周五出品方：亚太华影/导演：彭顺预计：豆瓣分5.5-6.5/票房2-5亿","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"最近儿年，所谓国产灾难片，最后都拍成了行业颂歌。医生、机长、消防员，都如是。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"这些电影最大问题就是普遍缺乏“人味儿”。按理说，灾难片拍的应该是大灾当下的人心莫测，但中国灾难片拍的是人定胜大。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"2019年的同类电影《烈火英雄》卖了17个乙，那也是赶上了市场的好时候，外加抢了题材之先，到今天，再照方抓药，恐怕不好使了。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"4月院线：小片扎堆，谁能突围？ · 配图 16","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-8979/fig-016.jpg","imageText":"检 《检察风云》\n4月30日震撼上映\n5.0\n期待值"},{"text":"上映日期：4月29日1第5个周六","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"出品方：最高人民检察院影视中心/导演：麦兆辉预计：豆瓣分5.0-6.0／票房5000万-1.5亿","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"不用看麦兆辉，不用看风云系列的名号，不用看王千源、白百何","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"看看制作单位就全明白了。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"编辑/子戈","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"排版/令令奇","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"}],"preface":[{"text":"夹在春节档和五一档之间，4月往往成为小众电影的聚集地。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"去年有《人生大事》异军突起，以17亿票房成为黑马。可今年的4月片单，却不见扛大旗的角色，成了名副其实的小众月。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"这里的小，并非纯然指“质量”，而是指“与大众情绪的共鸣程度”。今年4月显然没有那种极富煽动性和话题性的电影，但也不之小趣味、小惊喜。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"矮子里不必非得拔出将军来。大家只要各自矮出特色、矮出风格，就挺好。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"枪主笔子戈","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"}],"prefaceOffset":2}